 *   `/`; must not start with `-`, `/`, `.` (flag injection / hidden refs) and
 *   must not contain `..`, `//`, `@{`, or end with `/`, `.`, `.lock`.
 * @example isSafeRef('master') => true
 * @example isSafeRef('--upload-pack=x') => false
